  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To begin the process, Rental Items are Returned to the Store."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If the \"Customer returns the items to the store,\" then we can continue the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "if the \"Delivery Crew picks-up items at the event site,\" then we also continue the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "During this step, the items are counted and compared to the original contract."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "If the \"Order is complete and all items were returned,\" then we proceed with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "if the \"Order is incomplete and items are missing,\" we still continue the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "if the \"Order is complete but items are damaged,\" we email the customer to inform them of the damage and additional charges."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "In case of missing items and replacement charges, we email the customer to inform them."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "Additionally, if there are damaged items and additional charges, we temporarily take them out of inventory."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "If the \"Customer returns the missing items,\" we continue the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "content": "if the \"Customer does not return the missing items,\" we still continue the process. Finally, when the process is complete, it ends."
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "content": "If the \"Items are repaired and added into inventory,\" we continue the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i13",
      "content": "if the \"Items can't be repaired and are discarded,\" we email the customer with replacement charges."
    },
    {
      "id": "i14",
      "content": "Lastly, the items are packed for an existing order. If the \"Items are packed for an existing order,\" we continue the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i15",
      "content": "if the \"Items are stored for future orders,\" we also continue the process. Once again, when the process is complete, it ends."
    }
  ]
